      <h2 id="leak-intro-title">Reliable, Licensed Leak Detection, Available Around the Clock</h2>
      <p>Our background-checked Atlanta leak detection technicians arrive on time and explain every job upfront with flat-rate pricing. No surprise charges. No shortcuts. Just honest leak detection service from a company Metro Atlanta homeowners have trusted since 1974. Full-service leak detection is available for homes and businesses 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.</p>
      <p>A hidden leak in an Atlanta home rarely waits for business hours, and the longer it sits, the more it costs. Red Georgia clay holds moisture against your foundation, slab leaks quietly undermine pier-and-beam crawl spaces, and a slow drip behind drywall can rot framing in a matter of weeks. That is why we run fully staffed leak detection trucks 24/7 across Fulton, DeKalb, Cobb, Gwinnett, and the surrounding counties, dispatched with electronic amplifiers, thermal imaging, and tracer gas equipment that locates the leak without breaking up your floors or yard.</p>
      <p>When we arrive, you get a real diagnosis and a flat-rate price before any work starts. Our plumbers are licensed in Georgia, drug-tested, and trained on the same equipment used by municipal water departments. Whether it's a slab leak in a Sandy Springs ranch, a main-line break under a Decatur driveway, or a slow rise on the water bill of a Buckhead high-rise, the number on your invoice is the number you'll pay. That's what fifty-plus years of serving Atlanta has taught us: do it right, do it once, and stand behind it.</p>
