        <li><h3>Same-day service available</h3><p>Fully staffed trucks run day and night across Metro Atlanta.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Serving 50+ Metro Atlanta Communities</h3><p>From Stockbridge to Alpharetta, with fast response times.</p></li>
